## 🔐 Security & Scalability Notes

* Use environment variables for Cloudinary and MongoDB credentials.
* Use threading or async for better performance on real-time video streams.
* Consider batch processing for multiple cameras.
* Optimize face encoding storage using indexing.

---

## ✅ Final Tips

* Train the system with multiple images of each employee for better recognition.
* Use `dlib` or `DeepFace` if you want to experiment with other models.
* You can scale this to a distributed system with message queues (RabbitMQ/Kafka) and workers if you need to track many cameras.

